;pylm
; Font styles:
;    0: TDecorate(count=738, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    1: TDecorate(count=12, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=なかじまちょうじ, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=798, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=750, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\パソコン.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Er, thank you for taking time out of your busy day to watch the Motoki-cho official channel.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I am <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="なかじまちょうじ">Choji Nakajima</STYLE>, mayor of Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I will get straight to the point: I have an announcement for everyone in Motoki-cho, and in Sawa Prefecture.<PG>
I, <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="なかじまちょうじ">Choji Nakajima</STYLE>, will be retiring as mayor at the end of this term.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Looking back, it was 24 years ago, when I was 35.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the time, Motoki-cho's population had begun to grow, and it was in the middle of developing, little by little, into a bigger town.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted to make it a bigger town, a prosperous town second to none among the cities, towns and villages of Japan, and with that in mind I have given my all for 24 years.<PG>
Thanks to all of you, I received tremendous support and was able to fulfill every pledge I made, and as a result, Motoki-cho has achieved unprecedented growth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The economy, tourism, safety. Every one of them is a wonderful strength of Motoki-cho that we can be proud of before all of Japan.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From here on, I intend to leave the future to the younger generation and watch over Motoki-cho's further development.<PG>
However, at this age, I have found a new dream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I want to use the know-how I cultivated in the responsible job of mayor of Motoki-cho for Japan this time, 
{PAUSE ""}
I want to make Japan bigger, like Motoki-cho.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That is how I came to think.<PG>
Accordingly, I will be running in the House of Representatives election to be held next month.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have no experience in national politics, but given my age, I believe this is my last chance.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Townspeople of Motoki-cho, even once it leaves my hands, this town will go on developing.<PG>
I wish to entrust Motoki-cho to its young people, and to those with good hearts.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I am elected to the House of Representatives, this is my hometown, and I owe who I am today to all of you.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So that I may come home in glory, from now on I will devote myself to Japan.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I ask for your continued support of <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="なかじまちょうじ">Choji Nakajima</STYLE>.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------